MatchMaster is a real-time C++ port of the algorithm of Matchering:
  Matchering - Audio Matching and Mastering Python Library
  Copyright (C) 2016-2022 Sergree
  https://github.com/sergree/matchering
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.

The following parts are direct ports of Matchering's code and keep its behaviour:
  Source/Core/Matcher.cpp     (level matching, matching EQ, smoothing, RMS correction)
  Source/Core/HyraxLimiter.h  (the "Hyrax" limiter, adapted to real time)
MatchMaster is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Matchering project.

